*** Settings ***
Documentation       Business actions with the interface - these keywords are used in tests.
Resource            ${EXECDIR}/resources/interactions/api_interactions.resource


*** Keywords ***
Fetch Todo
    [Documentation]    Fetches the todo with the given number and returns the response.
    [Arguments]    ${number}
    ${response}    Send Get Request    ${API_TODOS}/${number}
    RETURN    ${response}

Fetch Todos Of User
    [Documentation]    Fetches all todos of a user and returns the response.
    [Arguments]    ${user}
    ${response}    Send Get Request    ${API_TODOS}    userId=${user}
    RETURN    ${response}

Create Post
    [Documentation]    Creates a new post with title and text and returns the response.
    [Arguments]    ${title}    ${text}    ${user}=1
    ${response}    Send Post Request    ${API_POSTS}    title=${title}    body=${text}    userId=${user}
    RETURN    ${response}
